{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","title":"Antagonistic Narcissism (Self-centered Antagonism)","description":"Inti gelap narsisme yang berorientasi pada dominasi, kontrol, dan eksploitasi.","tags":["psychology","npd","antagonistic"],"custom":{"description":"Inti gelap narsisme yang berorientasi pada dominasi, kontrol, dan eksploitasi."},"fname":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"4d9826de028b1f097cb3d7ba0716e577","updated":1782198659010,"created":1782198659010,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.npd","alias":"npd","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.npd"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.antagonistic","alias":"antagonistic","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.antagonistic"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":11,"offset":1084},"end":{"line":20,"column":60,"offset":1133},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":27,"column":89,"offset":1879},"end":{"line":27,"column":133,"offset":1923},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.antagonistic-narcissism"}],"anchors":{"antagonistic-narcissism-self-centered-antagonism":{"type":"header","text":"Antagonistic Narcissism (Self-centered Antagonism)","value":"antagonistic-narcissism-self-centered-antagonism","line":13,"column":0,"depth":1},"core-concept":{"type":"header","text":"Core Concept","value":"core-concept","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"the-power-dynamic":{"type":"header","text":"The Power Dynamic","value":"the-power-dynamic","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"manifestations":{"type":"header","text":"Manifestations","value":"manifestations","line":21,"column":0,"depth":2},"risk--mitigation":{"type":"header","text":"Risk & Mitigation","value":"risk--mitigation","line":25,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"antagonistic-narcissism-self-centered-antagonism\">Antagonistic Narcissism (Self-centered Antagonism)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#antagonistic-narcissism-self-centered-antagonism\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"antagonistic-narcissism-self-centered-antagonism-1\">Antagonistic Narcissism (Self-centered Antagonism)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#antagonistic-narcissism-self-centered-antagonism-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"core-concept\">Core Concept<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#core-concept\"></a></h2>\n<p>Antagonis adalah inti gelap dari narsisme. Ini berkaitan dengan <strong>entitlement, arrogance, exploitativeness, lack of empathy, devaluation, dan agresi</strong>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-power-dynamic\">The Power Dynamic<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#the-power-dynamic\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dalam dimensi ini, orang lain tidak dilihat sebagai subjek, melainkan sebagai <strong>alat</strong> untuk mencapai tujuan, validasi, atau pelampiasan emosi.</p>\n<h2 id=\"manifestations\">Manifestations<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#manifestations\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Di Lingkungan Kerja</strong>: Mengambil kredit kerja tim, merendahkan bawahan, memanipulasi narasi, dan menuntut loyalitas tanpa memberi perlindungan.</li>\n<li><strong>Di Hubungan Personal</strong>: <em>Gaslighting</em>, <em>silent treatment</em> sebagai hukuman, dan merasa pasangan wajib memenuhi kebutuhannya tanpa timbal balik.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"risk--mitigation\">Risk &#x26; Mitigation<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#risk--mitigation\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Risiko</strong>: Relasi berubah menjadi medan kuasa. Ini adalah dimensi yang paling berbahaya secara interpersonal.</li>\n<li><strong>Obat Sosial</strong>: <em>Boundary</em> yang tegas, pemberian konsekuensi nyata, dokumentasi, dan tidak memberi reward pada perilaku manipulatif.</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Antagonis = narsisme sebagai relasi kuasa. Orang lain bukan subjek, tapi alat.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">npd (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">antagonistic (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trifurcated-model-narcissism\">Trifurcated Model of Narcissism</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"sele